# Wrong output (PLAN.md): `add.s16x2` is read as one 32-bit add, so the
# store's address is 4·(0xffff + %tid.x) past param_0, where thread
# t >= 1 stores at param_0 + 4·(t - 1) (ptxas 13.4: `VIADD.16x2`).
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/packed_add.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store [4·%tid.x + param_0 + 262140] sectors/req 5 (ideal 4){{$}}
